//! Code: the bundle files NaN OS admits code as, the artefacts and sources they hold, the hashes naming them, the records of their admission, and the toolchain of the `nan` job that checks and builds them.

package code {
    language 1
    targets any
    dep ident "../ident"
    dep os "../os"
    allow capability in code
    allow validate in code, ident, os
} code
